---
title: "updateMyProfile (stem-system: Self-Service Profile Update)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_validate: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return error (login required)
    q_validate --> q_parse: profileUpdateSchema.safeParse(values)
    q_parse --> q_invalid: parse failed
    q_parse --> q_update: parse success
    q_invalid --> [*]: return error (invalid data)
    q_update --> q_admin_update: adminClient.members.update(student_number) where user_id
    q_admin_update --> q_update_err: error
    q_admin_update --> q_sync: success
    q_update_err --> [*]: return error (update failed)
    q_sync --> q_get_discord: select discord_uid from members
    q_get_discord --> q_has_discord: member found
    q_has_discord --> q_get_name: getMemberDisplayName(discord_uid)
    q_get_name --> q_sync_nick: syncDiscordNickname if name found
    q_sync_nick --> q_sync_roles: syncDiscordRoles(discord_uid)
    q_sync_roles --> q_revalidate: revalidatePath
    q_revalidate --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_admin_update
        INV-001: profile update uses adminClient to bypass RLS
        INV-002: only student_number field can be updated by the user
    end note
